        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sia, Nigel Corsbie, Sergei Prokofiev, Sergei O. Prokofieff, Oleg Prokofiev, Lina Prokofiev, Sofia Korovina\n- Works: Taken for Granted, Montagues and Capulets, Party Like a Russian\n\nFacts:\n- Sergei Prokofiev wrote the classical music work \"Montagues and Capulets.\"\n- Sergei O. Prokofieff was the grandson of Sergei Prokofiev and Lina Prokofiev.\n- Sergei O. Prokofieff was the son of Oleg Prokofiev and Sofia Korovina.\n- Sia wrote \"Taken for Granted.\"\n- Nigel Corsbie produced \"Taken for Granted.\"\n- \"Taken for Granted\" heavily samples Sergei Prokofiev's \"Montagues and Capulets.\"\n- The chorus of \"Party Like a Russian\" samples Sergei Prokofiev's \"Montagues and Capulets.\"",
